& [Requirements]
  + [SAC5F-001] define strict versioned curator policy grant signed selection and verified receipt forms
  + [SAC5F-002] distinguish governed_selection from synthetic_fixture_only use status
  + [SAC5F-003] bind policy and selection to exact raw Slice5A baseline SHA256 and report digest
  + [SAC5F-004] require one trusted curator key allowed query exact authority scope and selected-candidate source requirement
  + [SAC5F-005] require selected query candidate ambiguity and exact source-anchor membership in the bound dossier
  + [SAC5F-006] verify Ed25519 over canonical selection payload bytes before emitting a receipt
  + [SAC5F-007] bind receipt to selection digest curator candidate expression source anchor policy status and signature result
  + [SAC5F-008] refuse unknown fields duplicate curator grants malformed keys signatures stale baseline candidate source query status and digest changes
  + [SAC5F-009] provide deterministic generator verifier CLI and checked synthetic fixture evidence
  + [SAC5F-010] preserve all correction target_unit_id values null and grant no semantic truth training execution permission or effect authority
  + [SAC5F-011] pass focused debug release Clippy format evidence attribution and publication gates
  + [SAC5F-012] no scanner catalogue corpus provider persistence remote FPGA or Minecraft behavior change

